rd 500 and amulet 300 -> payout 600 (deductible per event)\");\n  it.todo(\"cursed sword, damage 2500 -> payout 2000 (cap based on unmodified insurance value)\");\n  it.todo(\"two successive claims of 1500 on a sword -> [1400/rem600, 600/rem0] (cap exhaustion)\");\n  it.todo(\"two swords both damaged 500 each -> payout 800, remainingCap 3200\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"runScenario - errors\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"unknown item type in quote -> throws\");\n  it.todo(\"claim references item not in policy -> throws\");\n  it.todo(\"claim references unknown item type -> throws\");\n  it.todo(\"claim damage with negative amount -> throws\");\n  it.todo(\"more damage entries of a type than covered -> throws\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"CLI integration\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"schema example: amulet quote + claim -> [{premium:59},{payout:100,remainingCap:1100}]\");\n  it.todo(\"CLI exits non-zero on unknown item type, writes stderr, no stdout results\");\n  it.todo(\"CLI exits non-zero on negative damage amount\");\n});\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907008728},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to run the test suite to make sure everything still works, then assess whether the refactoring is worth pursuing.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01WnV2ZvVTgVQ3Gqh54aVikx","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8 && pnpm test 2>&1 | tail -15"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":2237,"output":150,"cacheRead":9894,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":12281,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907008728,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-7fa68edb-6ef5-49f8-b8ef-5a4f4a052a0f","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01WnV2Z